{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52128","headline":"五言奉和行经破薛举战地应诏 · 上官仪","name":"五言奉和行经破薛举战地应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"策星暎霄极，飞鸿浃地区。\n鲔水腾周驾，涿鹿惊轩弧。\n荣河开秘篆，柳谷荐灵符。\n天游御长策，侮食被来苏。\n秋原怀八阵，武校烛三駈。\n投石堙旧垒，削树委荒途。\n□野惊[宵]（霄）磷，颓墉噪晚乌。\n毒泾晦凉雨，塞井蔽荒芜。\n冲情朗金镜，睿藻邃玄珠。\n□恩奉御什，抚己滥齐竽。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}